pike, flood from the two bbox edges meeting at the opposite\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2781:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/3/code.py:53:#      Replacement: use one of the four 45-degree diagonal vectors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2782:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/3/code.py:55:#      Replacement: consult the original input grid `g` at each diagonal step and stop at the first\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2783:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/3/code.py:59:#    - The full diagonal ray for each cup is reserved, so no other cup or obstacle can land on it.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2784:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/3/code.py:63:#    - The corner spike makes the path visibly diagonal rather than orthogonal.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2785:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/3/code.py:67:#    - The original optional mouth-side stray noise is removed in this combo. The diagonal cup and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2786:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/3/code.py:76:#      larger, so the combo output differs from the diagonal-no-obstacle baseline on every cup.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2787:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/3/code.py:81:#    - Solver assumes any blocker is already present in the input and lies on the same diagonal ray.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2788:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/3/code.py:93:# Obstacle must be at least 3 diagonal steps away from the spike, so the visible free prefix is >= 2.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2789:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/3/code.py:167:    Eject content pixels