ice((\"vertical\", \"horizontal\", \"diagonal\"))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2799:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/17/code.py:316:    - Detach the segment from that elbow-side root and route it toward the nearest obstacle, along the obstacle skin, then out diagonally on the far side.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2800:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/7/code.py:7:#    The scene grammar stays close to the source task: a thick anti-diagonal\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2801:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/7/code.py:462:    \"\"\"Return a boolean mask for a thick meandering anti-diagonal band.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2802:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7b3084d4/15/code.py:243:    - Read the structured input layout around that anchor: the piece left of it becomes the output's top-right part, the piece below it becomes bottom-left, and the diagonal piece becomes bottom-right.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2803:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/45a5af55/18/code.py:61:   - diagonal diamond silhouette with empty corners\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2804:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2d0172a1/7/code.py:559:    mode = random.choice((\"vertical\", \"horizontal\", \"diagonal\")) if mode is None else mode\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2805:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2d0172a1/7/code.py:633:        modes = [\"vertical\", \"diagonal\", \"horizontal\"]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2806:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2d0172a1/7/code.py:635:        modes = [\"horizontal\", \"diagonal\", \"vertical\"]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:2807:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2d0172a1